# Concept art — generator output, not content.
#
# The repo is ~3 MB of history and 532 KB of committed PNGs, because shipped
# art is .pix text plus ~350-byte exports. Concept sheets are 1K-4K renders at
# hundreds of KB each, several candidates per accepted sheet, and the Knock It
# Off prompt book alone calls for 226 of them. Committing those would be a
# permanent two-orders-of-magnitude increase in clone size for files that are
# reproducible from the prompts beside them.
#
# The prompts (.md) ARE committed. The output is not.
assets/concept/**/*.png
assets/concept/**/*.jpg
assets/concept/**/*.jpeg
assets/concept/**/*.webp
assets/concept/**/*.gif
